diff -u flag is used to provided a readable formate of data

diff -u version1.txt version2.txt > version.patch

diff -u version1.txt version2.txt > version.patch ==> This command is used to create a patch file.

To apply the patch 
------------------

patch p1 version1.txt < version.patch

To revert the file 
------------------

path p1 version1.txt < version.patch 

